flowchart LR
    INPUT[Typed input]
    PROMPT[System prompt + untrusted blocks]
    JSON_SCHEMA[JSON Schema from Zod]
    PROVIDER[LLM provider]
    PARSE[JSON parse]
    ZOD[Zod validation]
    IDS[Reference allowlist]
    REPAIR[One repair attempt]
    RESULT[Accepted output]
    ERROR[Error]

    INPUT --> PROMPT --> JSON_SCHEMA --> PROVIDER --> PARSE --> ZOD --> IDS
    IDS -->|valid| RESULT
    PARSE -->|invalid| REPAIR
    ZOD -->|invalid| REPAIR
    IDS -->|invalid| REPAIR
    REPAIR -->|valid| RESULT
    REPAIR -->|invalid| ERROR
